{"title":"Celestial Blossom","slug":"Celestial_Blossom","hero":{"file":"CBlossomFront.webp","width":400,"height":390},"pageid":4191,"revid":18656,"timestamp":"2025-06-29T08:08:35Z","lastEditor":"Breezus0109","categories":["Stubs"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Price","value":"$75"},{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"TBA"},{"label":"optional Title","value":"Celestial Blossom"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p><span>This page is a <a href=\"__BASE__/category/Stubs/\">stub</a>!</span><br>\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Celestial_Blossom?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.<br><small><b>Note</b>: More locations, more info!!!</small></span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><big><i>\"A mythical flower said to bloom only under starlight.\"</i></big>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n\n<p><br>\nThe <b>Celestial Blossom</b> is a flower found in vines under a few arches around <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay</a>. This flower is mostly found on vines below arches/cave roofs, especially around the high areas of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowering_Meadows/\">Flowering Meadows</a>.\n</p><p>It isn't on all vines of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay</a>, which otherwise spawns in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Grapes/\">Grapes</a> or nothing at all.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"a02d03d35cb9e0535b834927d92cd3a8\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div>Locations (might not be all of them yet)</div><div><div><div id=\"CBlossomL1-webp\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/CBlossomL1.webp/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location 1 of the Celestial Blossom, found near Flora Laura.\">Location 1 of the Celestial Blossom, found near Flora Laura.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location 1 of the Celestial Blossom, found near Flora Laura.\">Location 1 of the Celestial Blossom, found near Flora Laura.</span></a></div></div><div>Location 1 of the Celestial Blossom, found near <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flora_Laura/\">Flora Laura</a>.</div></div><div><div><div id=\"CBlossomL2-webp\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/CBlossomL2.webp/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location 2 of the Celestial Blossom, found near the first location and Flora Laura.\">Location 2 of the Celestial Blossom, found near the first location and Flora Laura.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location 2 of the Celestial Blossom, found near the first location and Flora Laura.\">Location 2 of the Celestial Blossom, found near the first location and Flora Laura.</span></a></div></div><div>Location 2 of the Celestial Blossom, found near the first location and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flora_Laura/\">Flora Laura</a>.</div></div><div><div><div id=\"CBlossomL3-webp\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/CBlossomL3.webp/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location 3 of the Celestial Blossom, found around the left of the Lost Woods.\">Location 3 of the Celestial Blossom, found around the left of the Lost Woods.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location 3 of the Celestial Blossom, found around the left of the Lost Woods.\">Location 3 of the Celestial Blossom, found around the left of the Lost Woods.</span></a></div></div><div>Location 3 of the Celestial Blossom, found around the left of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lost_Woods/\">Lost Woods</a>.</div></div><div><div><div id=\"CBlossomL4-webp\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/CBlossomL4.webp/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location 4 of the Celestial Blossom, found near the Blizzard Bloom Temple in the Flowering Meadows.\">Location 4 of the Celestial Blossom, found near the Blizzard Bloom Temple in the Flowering Meadows.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location 4 of the Celestial Blossom, found near the Blizzard Bloom Temple in the Flowering Meadows.\">Location 4 of the Celestial Blossom, found near the Blizzard Bloom Temple in the Flowering Meadows.</span></a></div></div><div>Location 4 of the Celestial Blossom, found near the Blizzard Bloom Temple in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowering_Meadows/\">Flowering Meadows</a>.</div></div><div><div><div id=\"CBlossomL5-webp\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/CBlossomL5.webp/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location 5 of the Celestial Blossom, found under the bridge that crosses above the Lost Woods.\">Location 5 of the Celestial Blossom, found under the bridge that crosses above the Lost Woods.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location 5 of the Celestial Blossom, found under the bridge that crosses above the Lost Woods.\">Location 5 of the Celestial Blossom, found under the bridge that crosses above the Lost Woods.</span></a></div></div><div>Location 5 of the Celestial Blossom, found under the bridge that crosses above the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lost_Woods/\">Lost Woods</a>.</div></div></div>"}
